WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:10.506
Green: booked. Spoi's session and a
TermTime booking match.

2
00:00:10.606 --> 00:00:15.508
The booking's activity ID
links the two.

3
00:00:15.608 --> 00:00:20.510
Blue: a session with no booking
in TermTime yet.

4
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:26.512
The box shows its room in
Núverandi lausn (current solution).

5
00:00:26.612 --> 00:00:31.513
Orange: a TermTime booking
with no session in Spoi.

6
00:00:31.613 --> 00:00:35.513
Its details come straight
from TermTime.

7
00:00:35.613 --> 00:00:40.514
“Búa til tíma” (create session)
makes a session from it.

8
00:00:40.614 --> 00:00:46.516
“Fjarlægja bókun” (remove booking)
works once TermTime is connected.

9
00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:52.517
“Ekki tímasett” (not scheduled):
sessions with no time yet.

10
00:00:57.621 --> 00:01:03.627
On a busier course, the pills
appear a moment after it loads.

11
00:01:03.727 --> 00:01:08.629
Red: students who also have another
course at that time.

12
00:01:08.729 --> 00:01:14.631
The yellow box reports the status
of the session's current position.

13
00:01:14.731 --> 00:01:19.633
“14x6/14”: 14 students,
in 6 of the 14 weeks.

14
00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:25.636
Amber ⛔: the room is booked in
TermTime – booking would fail.

15
00:01:25.736 --> 00:01:30.638
Amber ⚠: another course has the
room in Núverandi lausn.

16
00:01:30.738 --> 00:01:36.640
Purple: a teacher who teaches
elsewhere at that time.

17
00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:41.641
The last line says what it was
checked against.
